name: sim.getStackTraceback
description: Lua only. Retrieves and clears the last generated stack traceback for a script
pythonSynopsis: string stackTraceback = sim.getStackTraceback(int scriptHandle)
inputs:
1. scriptHandle: the script handle from which the traceback is desired. If omitted, then the calling script's traceback will be retrieved and cleared.
outputs:
1. stackTraceback: the stack traceback
